### Customer Connector (domain system) — local smoke requests
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8096
@userId = user-1
@sessionId = user-1-session
@conversationId = chat-user-1

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Swagger UI (open in browser)
# {{baseUrl}}/swagger-ui/index.html

### Create a product
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "SKU-0001",
  "name": "Premium Wireless Headphones",
  "description": "Noise-cancelling over-ear headphones with 30h battery life. Great for travel and office use.",
  "category": "Headphones",
  "tags": "wireless,noise-cancelling,audio",
  "price": 199.99,
  "currency": "USD",
  "inStockQty": 25
}

### Create another product
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "SKU-0002",
  "name": "Compact Mechanical Keyboard",
  "description": "65% mechanical keyboard with hot-swappable switches and Bluetooth connectivity.",
  "category": "Keyboards",
  "tags": "mechanical,compact,bluetooth",
  "price": 129.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "inStockQty": 40
}

### Search products (deterministic; runtime owns vector search)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/search?q=wireless%20headphones&limit=5&threshold=0.3

### Create a policy (domain data; runtime owns RAG)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/policies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Refund Policy",
  "text": "Returns accepted within 30 days of delivery with receipt. Items must be in original condition. Refunds issued to original payment method within 5-10 business days after inspection.",
  "classification": "refund"
}

### Create a review (domain data; runtime owns vector indexing)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "sku": "SKU-0001",
  "rating": 4,
  "text": "Great sound and ANC. Very comfortable for long flights."
}

### Customer Connector action protocol: list products
POST {{baseUrl}}/actions/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actionId": "list_products",
  "params": {
    "query": "headphones"
  },
  "trace": {
    "requestId": "req-1",
    "conversationId": "{{conversationId}}",
    "userId": "{{userId}}",
    "sessionId": "{{sessionId}}"
  }
}

### Customer Connector action protocol: add to cart (write action + idempotency)
POST {{baseUrl}}/actions/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actionId": "add_to_cart",
  "idempotencyKey": "demo-add-to-cart-1",
  "params": {
    "items": [
      { "sku": "SKU-0001", "quantity": 1 }
    ]
  },
  "trace": {
    "requestId": "req-2",
    "conversationId": "{{conversationId}}",
    "userId": "{{userId}}",
    "sessionId": "{{sessionId}}"
  }
}

### Customer Connector action protocol: view cart
POST {{baseUrl}}/actions/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actionId": "view_cart",
  "params": {},
  "trace": {
    "requestId": "req-3",
    "conversationId": "{{conversationId}}",
    "userId": "{{userId}}",
    "sessionId": "{{sessionId}}"
  }
}

### List orders for the user (domain API)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?userId=user-1
